<title>POLAND: Polish zloty fixed down at 3.0350 to the dollar.</title>
<headline>Polish zloty fixed down at 3.0350 to the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0350 against the dollar, down from 3.0310 on Friday and at 1.7910 against the mark, up from 1.7985, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of 3.34 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, stronger than Friday's 3.17 percent fix.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
